  message: "SECOND INSTANCE, same shape, 2026-09-27 on branch jgstern-agent/fix/erlang-application-lifecycle (a YAML-only change): in a loaded 287-file targeted run (8,775 passed, 2 failed), tests/test_watcher_lifecycle.py::TestLauncherNamesTheOwner::test_owner_pid_comes_from_the_harness_variable failed with 'AssertionError: launcher did not start a watcher', beside a repeat of test_a_hangup_is_named_too. Both files re-run alone immediately after: 38 passed in 5.50s. Two auto-pr process-lifecycle tests that spawn a child and wait on it, both failing only under load, suggests the fixtures' waits (30s proc.wait; the launcher's watcher-start check) assume an unloaded machine, or a shared resource between them. Not diagnosed."  # c598
